# Agent configuration is tracked. These negations keep the files in the
# repository when a global or editor ignore rule would otherwise drop them.
# Add new ones here rather than below: git takes the last matching pattern, so
# a negation at the end of this file re-includes what the exclusions exclude.
!CLAUDE.md
!AGENTS.md
!.claude/
!.claude/**
!.agents/
!.agents/**

# Local overrides stay out of the repository.
.claude/settings.local.json
